+// unpack of each weight block runs once for all rows, and each row keeps its own accumulator,
+// thus the rows are independent vrmpy chains. The scale arithmetic of each row is the one of the
+// 32x1 kernel, thus the result of a row is bit-identical to a 32x1 call.
